 0 0 1 57.02362 660.1969 cm .498039 .117647 .227451 rg BT 14 TL/F3+0 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Aim)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 644.9969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (To build an anonymous FTP scanner using the ftplib module in Python.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 624.9969 cm .498039 .117647 .227451 rg BT 14 TL/F3+0 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Introduction)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 583.3969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm (An FTP scanner checks hosts for FTP servers that allow anonymous login. ftplib is Python's built-in)Tj T* (library for working with the File Transfer Protocol: it connects to servers, logs in, lists directories and)Tj T* (transfers files.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 563.3969 cm .498039 .117647 .227451 rg BT 14 TL/F3+0 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Algorithm)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 548.1969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 7.2 TL/F4 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 6.2 Tm (l)Tj/F1 6 Tf T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 69.02362 548.1969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Import the ftplib module and define a function that accepts a hostname.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 518.7969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 7.2 TL/F4 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 19.4 Tm (l)Tj/F1 6 Tf T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 69.02362 518.7969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm (Create an FTP connection to the host and log in with username 'anonymous' and password)Tj T* ('anonymous'.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 489.3969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 7.2 TL/F4 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 19.4 Tm (l)Tj/F1 6 Tf T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 69.02362 489.3969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm (Store the server response; if it contains '230 Anonymous access granted', print a success message,)Tj T* (the welcome message and the directory listing.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 473.1969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 7.2 TL/F4 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 6.2 Tm (l)Tj/F1 6 Tf T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 69.02362 473.1969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (On an exception, print the error and a failure message.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 456.9969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 7.2 TL/F4 6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 6.2 Tm (l)Tj/F1 6 Tf T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 69.02362 456.9969 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Call the function with the target hostname.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 431.9969 cm .498039 .117647 .227451 rg BT 14 TL/F3+0 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Program Code)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 51.02362 273.9969 cm .960784 .960784 .960784 rg 0 154 493.2283 -154 re f* q 1 0 0 1 6 5 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 9.6 TL/F5+0 7.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 136.6 Tm (import ftplib)Tj T* (def anonymousLogin\(hostname\):)Tj T* (    try:)Tj T* (        ftp = ftplib.FTP\(hostname\))Tj T* (        response = ftp.login\('anonymous', 'anonymous'\))Tj T* (        print\(response\))Tj T* (        if "230 Anonymous access granted" in response:)Tj T* (            print\('\\n[*] ' + str\(hostname\) + ' FTP Anonymous Login Succeeded.'\))Tj T* (            print\(ftp.getwelcome\(\)\))Tj T* (            ftp.dir\(\))Tj T* (    except Exception as e:)Tj T* (        print\(str\(e\)\))Tj T* (        print\('\\n[-] ' + str\(hostname\) + ' FTP Anonymous Login Failed.'\))Tj T* (hostname = 'ftp.be.debian.org')Tj T* (anonymousLogin\(hostname\))Tj T* ET Q q .8 .8 .8 RG 1 J 1 j .5 w 0 154 m 493.2283 154 l S 0 0 m 493.2283 0 l S 0 0 m 0 154 l S 493.2283 0 m 493.2283 154 l S Q Q q q 1 0 0 1 56.02362 252.9969 cm .419608 .305882 .341176 rg BT 11 TL/F2+0 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2.8 Tm (Output \(paste screenshot\))Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 51.02362 137.9969 cm .419608 .305882 .341176 RG 1 J 1 j .7 w 0 130 m 493.2283 130 l S 0 0 m 493.2283 0 l S 0 0 m 0 130 l S 493.2283 0 m 493.2283 130 l S .3 w 0 0 m 493.2283 0 l S Q Q q 1 0 0 1 51.02362 101.7969 cm .913725 .968627 .937255 rg 0 25.2 493.2283 -25.2 re f* q 1 0 0 1 8 6 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 13.2 TL/F2+0 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm T* ET Q q .52549 .776471 .603922 RG 1 J 1 j .5 w 0 25.2 m 493.2283 25.2 l S 0 0 m 493.2283 0 l S 0 0 m 0 25.2 l S 493.2283 0 m 493.2283 25.2 l S Q Q Q q 480 0 0 43 56.02362 207.82697 cm /Im1 Do Q

